# Look up methods
# Steps of evaluation method call e0.m(e1,...,en)
# - eager evaluation of e0,e1,...,en to objects obj0,obj1,...,objn
# - obj0 is receiver of the method. Let C be the class of obj0 (every object has
# a class) 
# - we will use C to find code to execute: if C defined method m, we pick that
# method, else recur on C's superclass to check if defined method m, all the way
# up to class hierarchy of Object and BasicObject. The first m we find, that's
# the code we call. If n not found we call method_missing on C, if not defined
# recur till find it defined on Object which raises errror
# - evaluate body of method m in an environment where:
